\caption{\textbf{The ratio form ranks a plan that fails \RATIOWINOWNFAILED\ of \NTASKS\ tasks above a plan that solves \COMPCLEARED\ by \IPDRATIOOWN$\times$ on the owned basis, and a plan that fails \RATIOWINRENTFAILED\ above it by \IPDRATIORENT$\times$ on the rented basis.} On each basis, the maximizer of the ratio form over the priced plans of $\Pi$, then \COMPPLAN. \emph{Tasks per \$} is $|\mathcal{S}(\pi)|/R_\$(\pi,b)$ over the whole workload, not per attempted task, and \emph{Factor} the ratio of the two unrounded figures within a basis. Rows are drawn from the earlier frontier's \NDETERMINATE\ plans whose per-task outcomes pair at their tiers' depth of record, which predates the plan space of Appendix~\ref{app:limits}.}
\label{tab:degeneracy}
\setlength{\tabcolsep}{4pt}
\begin{tabular}{@{}l>{\raggedright\arraybackslash}p{0.28\textwidth}rrr@{}}
\toprule
